<title>USA: Morrow Snowboards president resigns.</title>
<headline>Morrow Snowboards president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SALEM, Ore. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morrow Snowboards Inc said Dennis Shelton resigned as president and chief operating officer to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>The company, which makes snowboards and related products, said it would not fill the position, but would instead assign sales, marketing and product-management responsibilities to Chief Executive Officer David Calapp.</p>
</text>
